%% Standalone Mermaid file — open as a Mermaid preview tab
flowchart TB
  subgraph Workspace
    Pin[Pinned folders]
    Tree[Lazy Files tree]
  end

  subgraph Preview
    Md[Markdown]
    Mmd[.mmd Mermaid]
    Img[Images]
  end

  Pin --> Tree
  Tree -->|double-click .md| Md
  Tree -->|double-click .mmd| Mmd
  Tree -->|double-click image| Img

  Md --> Status[Status bar stats]
  Mmd --> Zoom[Zoom / pan / fullscreen]
  Img --> Fit[In-app fit preview]
